    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExcellent three-bedroom semi-detached residence situated in the established and highly regarded Oranview development in Oranmore. No. 8 enjoys a convenient location within easy reach of Oranmore Village and all local amenities, offering an ideal balance of comfort, convenience and modern family living.\n\nThe property has been carefully maintained by its current owners and presents in excellent condition throughout. Accommodation on the ground floor comprises an entrance hall, a comfortable living room with an open fire, a spacious kitchen and dining area overlooking the rear garden, together with a utility room and guest WC. On the two upper floors, there are three bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite, and a main family bathroom.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from a private rear garden providing an ideal space for outdoor dining, gardening or relaxing, while the front driveway offers off-street parking. The development itself is mature and well maintained, making it particularly appealing to families, first-time buyers and those seeking a convenient village setting.\n\nLocated just a short distance from schools, shops, cafés, sporting facilities and public transport links, No. 8 also enjoys easy access to Galway City, the M6 Motorway and the many attractions of Oranmore and its surrounding area.\n\nOverall, No. 8 Oranview is a turnkey home in a highly desirable residential location, offering comfortable accommodation and excellent convenience for a wide range of purchasers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nSolid oak floor with recently installed carpet on stairs, coved ceiling.\n\nLiving Room: - \nSolid oak floor, 2 front aspect windows overlooking woods, open fire, coved ceiling, excellent storage.\n\nKitchen Dining Room: - \nTiled floor in dining area, tiled floor in kitchen, side aspect window & rear patio doors to south facing garden, built in kitchen, dishwasher, oven & gas hob.\n\nUtility Room: - \nTiled floor, built in storage, plumbed for washing machine, rear door.\n\nGuest WC: - \nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, mirror & light, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nSolid oak floor, built in wardrobe, rear aspect window.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nTiled floor & shower, wc, wash hand basin, shower, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nSolid oak floor, fitted wardrobe, tv point, front aspect window.\n\nMain Bathroom: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin, bath with overhead electric shower.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nLarge bright room, Maritime timber floor, dual aspect windows, fitted wardrobe.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nTiled floor & shower, wc, wash hand basin, shower, skylight.\n\nHot Press: - \nShelved, hot water tank.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
