        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully presented owner occupied home</li><li>Excellent location</li><li>Southerly facing rear aspect</li><li>Quiet & private cul de sac position</li><li>Hollow core</li><li>Gas central heating</li><li>Annual management fees approximately 400euro</ul>"
